{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_epi01_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "18a04d15b5aa5d46fb6134e374a1ad654330f4a4c35b9e632749bf09ecdd2639", "ja": "ふう……。終わっちゃったね？", "zh": "呼……结束了呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_epi01_1020_002chi", "source_sha256": "4af541452e13c387116ef17a96c91819d378955312006e34fb6316f2c07a80b5", "ja": "ええ……。終わっちゃった。", "zh": "嗯……结束了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_epi01_1021_001har", "source_sha256": "5542e57f438c3399013db6a77b17b0c8ec0e84f0725c2f99589b134becf1d74f", "ja": "……ふふふっ！", "zh": "……呵呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_epi01_1022_002chi", "source_sha256": "5542e57f438c3399013db6a77b17b0c8ec0e84f0725c2f99589b134becf1d74f", "ja": "……ふふふっ！", "zh": "……呵呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_epi01_1023_002chi", "source_sha256": "bd698593d6e34c1272706038570a29f21510b7838694b31e3e6a2e0d8897bbe9", "ja": "ライブではいつも思うけれど。\nなんだか、今日は特に……終わりたくなかった。", "zh": "虽然每次演唱会时我都会这么想，\n但总觉得，今天尤其……不想结束。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_epi01_1024_001har", "source_sha256": "11c0af4d9378e4d4dcd43ed8718b4737fc2648f5ddfbca3005e46da080cc686a", "ja": "そうだね。最後のお礼も、\n今日はギリギリまで言いたくなかったなぁ～。", "zh": "是啊。最后的致谢，\n今天也不想直到最后一刻才说呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_epi01_1025_001har", "source_sha256": "35109e0b43ceaeadae3df17ea039fc6ec47cc2a3fe2501f8f38bf2544e69404a", "ja": "でも、言わないと怒られちゃうもんね。\nお客さんの電車がなくなる～って！", "zh": "不过，不说的话会被骂的嘛。\n毕竟客人的末班电车要没了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_epi01_1026_002chi", "source_sha256": "5189c6f99b9ddd4ea7fd5a85ed451ea92aa4975a7cdb387abe1651039ea777fd", "ja": "ふふっ、そうね。\nいつまでもライブが終わらないと、みんな困るから。", "zh": "呵呵，是啊。\n演出一直不结束的话，大家都会很为难的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_epi01_1027_001har", "source_sha256": "2ca648b2ebc7fd43a7bef89008ec0e5aad67a42f64673202016a50c7dbb92455", "ja": "そうそう。それに、ちゃんと終わらせないと、\n次のライブもできないし。", "zh": "对对。而且要是不顺利结束的话，\n下一场演唱会也没法办了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_epi01_1028_002chi", "source_sha256": "e3f14048cd3fa67543b1f0f0f7af03e02f9b37c96531e7c3ab0666f85b21af8a", "ja": "次のライブ……。", "zh": "下一场演唱会……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_epi01_1029_001har", "source_sha256": "544d0afdff258c20a646cd64e80dd609bcbe6aa36ef00980e7b1b857ef640761", "ja": "うん！　ライブを始めて、終わらせて、\nそしてまた次のライブへ！", "zh": "嗯！开始演出，结束演出，\n然后再奔向下一场演出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_epi01_1030_001har", "source_sha256": "a1f1d04a41580a34076bde1f6ada5f6c105d9af617276491431c4a3ca908c74a", "ja": "私たち、ずっとそうしてきたよね。\n今までも。……だから、これからも！", "zh": "我们一直都是这样走过来的，对吧。\n到现在为止也是。……所以，往后也会继续！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_epi01_1031_002chi", "source_sha256": "bb041f0808b9a9f67a196f7f6e5f85f5cffa76077e4fb0adc8339c326bc54f93", "ja": "……ええ。\n今までの積み重ねを、これからも。", "zh": "……嗯。\n将至今为止的一切积累，继续延续下去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_epi01_1032_101kot", "source_sha256": "ed12f4a8257fe4cda93ff411842e329858306e32f00ae85a05890c235af9df56", "ja": "あっ、二人ともまだ着替えてない！\nもう、早くしないと、風邪を引いたら大変よ？", "zh": "啊，你们两个都还没换衣服呢！\n真是的，不快点换的话，要是感冒了可就糟糕了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_epi01_1033_101kot", "source_sha256": "419ac1c6eddd42d09749778ad989d2ba9d661c65b3bacbdde40eb7989dfaa1eb", "ja": "それに……社長と、美咲ちゃんと\n{$P$}さんも待ってるんだから！", "zh": "而且……社长、美咲，还有{$P$}先生都在等着呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_epi01_1034_001har", "source_sha256": "768f1d1c55b7e5cbac56b30b0c7fe55fd2f44fe48c72547e2c78aa0d3c37cea2", "ja": "……、はーい！", "zh": "……好——的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_epi01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_epi01_1035_002chi", "source_sha256": "e8106d05ea91b75b562ec818211915687d563a6dbaa4aecb0cc29bce9d42504f", "ja": "……、はいっ！", "zh": "……好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
